---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lang = 'en';
---

<Layout
  title="Legal Notice (Impressum) — SprachCafé Polnisch e.V."
  description="Legal disclosure and association register details for SprachCafé Polnisch e.V. pursuant to § 5 DDG / MStV."
  lang={lang}
>
  <div class="py-12 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="text-center sm:text-left space-y-3 border-b border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] pb-8">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#8B263E]/10 border border-[#8B263E]/20 text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        Legal Disclosure
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-[#1d1b1a] dark:text-[#f5f0ee] tracking-tight">
        Legal Notice (Impressum)
      </h1>
      <p class="font-sans text-base text-[#5b403d] dark:text-[#d4c5c2]">
        Statutory disclosures pursuant to German Telecommunications and Media Legislation (DDG/MStV).
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Container -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#22201e] border border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm space-y-10 text-[#1d1b1a] dark:text-[#f5f0ee] leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- 1. Address and Contact -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f]">
          Address &amp; Contact
        </h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-1 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <p class="font-bold">SprachCafé Polnisch e.V.</p>
          <p>Schulzestr. 1</p>
          <p>D-13187 Berlin (Germany)</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm pt-2">
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:kontakt@sprachcafe-polnisch.org" class="text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f] underline">kontakt@sprachcafe-polnisch.org</a></p>
          <p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+4916099680059" class="text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f] underline">+49 (0)160 9968 0059</a></p>
          <p><strong>Library:</strong> <a href="mailto:bibliothek@sprachcafe-polnisch.org" class="text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f] underline">bibliothek@sprachcafe-polnisch.org</a></p>
          <p><strong>Speak-Dating:</strong> <a href="mailto:speak-dating@sprachcafe-polnisch.org" class="text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f] underline">speak-dating@sprachcafe-polnisch.org</a></p>
          <p class="sm:col-span-2"><strong>Accounting &amp; Administration:</strong> <a href="mailto:verwaltung@sprachcafe-polnisch.org" class="text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f] underline">verwaltung@sprachcafe-polnisch.org</a></p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5b403d] dark:text-[#d4c5c2] mb-2">Social Media:</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-xs">
            <a href="https://www.facebook.com/sprachcafe.polnisch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors">Facebook: SprachCafé Polnisch e.V.</a>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/sprachcafepolnisch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors">Instagram: @sprachcafepolnisch</a>
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@sprachcafepolnischev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors">YouTube: SprachCafé Polnisch</a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/sprachcafe-polnisch-ev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors">LinkedIn: SprachCafé Polnisch e.V.</a>
            <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@sprachcafepolnisch" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors">TikTok: SprachCafé Polnisch e.V.</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. Non-profit Status & Register -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f]">
          Registered Non-Profit Association
        </h2>
        <p>SprachCafé Polnisch is a registered non-profit association (eingetragener gemeinnütziger Verein – e.V.).</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span>📄</span>
            <span>
              <a href="/downloads/Satzung-SCP-12.06.2020.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f] underline">Constitution dated 12.06.2020 (PDF)</a>:
              Association Register – Amtsgericht Berlin-Charlottenburg – Register number: VR 35014 B
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span>🏛️</span>
            <span>
              <a href="/downloads/Freistellungsbescheid_01.07.2026.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f] underline">Tax Exemption Notice (Freistellungsbescheid 01.07.2026, PDF)</a>:
              Finanzamt für Körperschaften I in Berlin, Tax ID: 27 677 / 67313
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Board of Directors -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f]">
          Board of Directors
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li><strong>Agata Koch</strong> – President &amp; Chairwoman</li>
          <li><strong>Agnieszka Ghanname</strong> – Vice President</li>
          <li><strong>Kasia Koziol</strong> – Vice President</li>
          <li><strong>Elke Albers</strong> – Treasurer</li>
          <li><strong>Sandra Filip-Badura</strong> – Secretary</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5b403d] dark:text-[#d4c5c2] italic pt-2">
          Board meetings occur regularly once a month online. Dates are determined internally.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. Membership -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f]">
          Become a Member!
        </h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center">
          <a
            href="/downloads/Eintrittsformular-03.2020-1.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#8B263E] hover:bg-[#6e1e31] text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all shadow-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>📥 Membership Form (PDF)</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/en/mitmachen/mitglied-werden/"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] border border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] text-[#1d1b1a] dark:text-[#f5f0ee] hover:border-[#8B263E] font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Online Membership Application &rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 5. Bank Account Details -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f]">
          Bank Account
        </h2>
        <div class="bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] p-5 rounded-2xl border border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] text-sm space-y-1 font-mono">
          <p class="font-sans font-bold text-base">Deutsche Skatbank</p>
          <p><strong>IBAN:</strong> DE79 8306 5408 0004 9743 36</p>
          <p><strong>BIC:</strong> GENO DEF1 SLR</p>
          <p class="font-sans pt-2"><strong>Payment Reference:</strong> „Membership fee / Donation SprachCafé Polnisch e.V.“</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#5b403d] dark:text-[#d4c5c2] leading-relaxed">
          Thank you for all contributions supporting our work. To receive a tax deduction certificate, please include your full name and address in the reference field.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 6. Annual Activity Reports -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f]">
          Activity Reports &amp; Transparency Documents
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs font-semibold">
          <a href="/downloads/TaetigkeitsberichtSteuererklaerung-SCP-2025-sw.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-3 bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] rounded-xl hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors border border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] text-center block">📄 Report 2025 (PDF)</a>
          <a href="/downloads/TaetigkeitsberichtSteuererklaerung-SCP-2024-sw.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-3 bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] rounded-xl hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors border border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] text-center block">📄 Report 2024 (PDF)</a>
          <a href="/downloads/TaetigkeitsberichtSteuererklaerung-SCP-2023.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-3 bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] rounded-xl hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors border border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] text-center block">📄 Report 2023 (PDF)</a>
          <a href="/downloads/TaetigkeitsberichtSteuererklaerung-SCP_FA_2022.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-3 bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] rounded-xl hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors border border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] text-center block">📄 Report 2022 (PDF)</a>
          <a href="/downloads/Sachbericht_2021_Homepage_Zweck_Veranstaltung.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-3 bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] rounded-xl hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors border border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] text-center block">📄 Report 2021 (PDF)</a>
          <a href="/downloads/Sachbericht_2020_Homepage.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-3 bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] rounded-xl hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors border border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] text-center block">📄 Report 2020 (PDF)</a>
          <a href="/downloads/TatigkeitsberichtSteuererklarung-SCP-2019.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-3 bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] rounded-xl hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors border border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] text-center block">📄 Report 2019 (PDF)</a>
          <a href="/downloads/TatigkeitsberichtSteuererklarung-SCP-2018.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-3 bg-[#f8f2f0] dark:bg-[#2a2725] rounded-xl hover:bg-[#8B263E]/10 hover:text-[#8B263E] transition-colors border border-[#e7e1df] dark:border-[#363230] text-center block">📄 Report 2018 (PDF)</a>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-xs">
          <a href="/downloads/Fur-Demokratie-und-Menschenrechte.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-bold text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f] underline">
            <span>📜 For Democracy and Human Rights (PDF)</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-[#5b403d] dark:text-[#d4c5c2]">
          We are signatories of the German Diversity Charter (Charta der Vielfalt). <a href="https://www.charta-der-vielfalt.de/fuer-arbeitgebende/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#8B263E] dark:text-[#ff758f] font-semibold underline">Learn more …</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 7. Independence Clause -->
      <section class="space-y-2 text-xs text-[#5b403d] dark:text-[#d4c5c2]">
        <p class="font-bold text-sm text-[#1d1b1a] dark:text-[#f5f0ee]">Content &amp; Opinion Disclaimer:</p>
        <p>
          SprachCafé Polnisch is an open platform for dialogue and cultural exchange. Statements and opinions expressed by individual speakers, artists, and event hosts do not necessarily reflect the official views of the board of SprachCafé Polnisch e.V.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
